<title>UK: IPE futures trading suspended due power cut - source.</title>
<headline>IPE futures trading suspended due power cut - source.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading on London's International Petroleum Exchange (IPE) has been suspended due to an electricity outage that blanked out the wall board that quotes prices, trader sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>They said the screen blanked out at around 1820 GMT. &quot;The screens are not working on the floor,&quot; a broker said.</p>
<p>--London newsroom 542 4984</p>
